sherpa-onnx (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx)
  Apache License 2.0. Runs the speaker and speech models. NuGet package org.k2fsa.sherpa.onnx.

ONNX Runtime (https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime)
  MIT License, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. Native library shipped inside the sherpa-onnx package.

WeSpeaker ResNet34-LM speaker embedding model (wespeaker_en_voxceleb_resnet34_LM.onnx)
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International. WeSpeaker states that its pretrained models follow the licence of
  their training data; the VoxCeleb models follow CC BY 4.0
  (https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker/blob/master/docs/pretrained.md). Model by the WeSpeaker authors, trained on VoxCeleb.

Whisper base.en speech recognition model (OpenAI), as converted for sherpa-onnx
