Test fixtures only (tests/StepUp.Verifier.Tests/Audio/), not part of the service:
Piper en_US-libritts_r-medium voice model, trained on LibriTTS-R
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (model card shipped with the model; dataset http://www.openslr.org/141/).
  The eight WAV fixtures are synthetic speech produced with this model.
